        "raw": "<p>Also, if asked to reveal cards from a deck and do different things with each of them when there aren&#39;t enough cards, you only do as much as you can, in order. As an example, if you&#39;re playing the Adept and use Arcane Cadence (which reveals five cards) when you only have three cards left in your deck, you&#39;d reveal those three and do the first three things listed on Arcane Cadence (but culd choose which card each thing applied to - the reveal order doesn&#39;t matter, only what you need to do with them when your actions are limited by not having enough cards).</p>",
